of the particular work assignment and the contractor agrees to perform such changed
work.
4.Materials, Equipment, and Labor: The Contractor undertakes and agrees tofurnish and
pay for all materials, supplies, labor, transportation, quipment, tools, services and
supervision necessary to perform any services here under.
